1. Proiect Title
Loan Approval Prediction Using Machine Learning


2. Problem Statement
To develop a machine learning system that predicts whether a loan application will be approved or rejected based on applicant and loan-related information such as income, credit history, loan amount, and employment status.


3. Obiective
To analyze and preprocess loan application data. 
To identify important factors affecting loan approval.
To build a machine learning model for loan approval prediction.  
To evaluate the model using suitableclassification metrics.


4. AI/ML Type
AI/ML: Machine Learning
Learning Type: Supervised Learning 
Problem Type: Binary Classification 
Target: Loan Approval Status - Approved/ Rejected 
Algorithms: Logistic Regression, KNN, etc.


5. Expected Outcome
To develop a classification model that can accurately predict whether a new loan application is Approved or Rejected and evaluate its performance using Accuracy,Precision, Recall, and F1-score